---
import '../styles/components/forms.css';
import '../styles/components/ContactPage.css';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import AttackDemo from './AttackDemo.astro';
import pages from '../data/pages.json';
const page=pages.find(p=>p.slug==='contact')!;
---
<section class="contact-grid wrap"><div class="contact-intro"><span class="eyebrow">LOCAL FORM DEMONSTRATION</span><h1>{page.headline}</h1><p>{page.summary}</p><div class="contact-steps"><article><h2>The sample environment.</h2><p>Start with the synthetic cloud resources and identities in the sample.</p></article><article><h2>The review workflow.</h2><p>Explore the review, ownership, and handoff your teams need.</p></article><article><h2>A proposed next step.</h2><p>See how a connected path can become a specific change.</p></article></div><p class="article-note">Portfolio demo: this form sends nothing. You can explore the platform below without entering any information.</p></div><div><form class="contact-form" data-contact-form action="#main" method="get"><h2>Try the local form.</h2><p>Enter fictional sample details to preview the confirmation. Required fields are marked with an asterisk.</p><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="first-name">First name *</label><input id="first-name" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="Alex" required maxlength="80"/></div><div class="field"><label for="last-name">Last name *</label><input id="last-name" autocomplete="family-name" placeholder="Morgan" required maxlength="80"/></div></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Work email *</label><input type="email" id="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="alex@example.com" required maxlength="180"/></div><div class="field"><label for="company">Company *</label><input id="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Your company" required maxlength="120"/></div><div class="field"><label for="team">Your team *</label><select id="team" required><option value="">Choose a team</option><option>Cloud security</option><option>Security operations</option><option>Platform engineering</option><option>Portfolio reviewer</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="message">What would you like to explore?</label><textarea id="message" placeholder="Tell us about the workflow you have in mind." maxlength="2000"></textarea></div><button class="button" type="submit">Preview the local confirmation<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16}/></button><p class="form-note">As described by this demo, inputs remain on the page and are neither sent nor stored. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</p><noscript><p class="form-note">The local form demonstration needs JavaScript. You can explore the platform below without it.</p></noscript></form><div class="form-status" data-form-status hidden role="status" tabindex="-1"></div></div></section><section class="section wrap" style="padding-top:30px"><div class="section-header"><h2>Explore the sample without the form.</h2><p>Inspect a synthetic relationship and its proposed intervention. No email address or cloud credentials are required.</p></div><AttackDemo/></section>
